{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02559","headline":"奉和过旧宅应制 · 许敬宗","name":"奉和过旧宅应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"飞云临紫极，出震表青光。\n自尔家寰海，今兹返帝乡。\n情深感代国，乐甚讌谯方。\n白水浮佳气，黄星聚太常。\n岐凤鸣层阁，酆雀贺雕梁。\n桂山犹总翠，蘅薄尚流芳。\n攀鳞有遗皓，沐德拚称觞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许敬宗","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02559.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02559","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}